# =====================================================================
# Release V063 -- Fact_Appointment_Journey windowed next-pointers (perf)
# =====================================================================
# Replace the 4x correlated OUTER APPLY TOP-1 next-appointment pointers in
# Gold.usp_Load_Fact_Appointment_Journey with a single windowed pass
# (FIRST_VALUE ... IGNORE NULLS + a LAST_VALUE tie broadcast that preserves the
# strict "Start_Time >" semantics). The APPLYs were O(n^2) on a columnstore work
# table Fabric cannot index -> ~13 min on ~173k rows; windowed = ~4s.
#
# Output is byte-identical: verified 0 pointer mismatches over 246,520 dev rows
# (same rows, same keys). Pure DROP/CREATE of the proc -- the next build rebuilds
# the table with identical data, so nothing downstream shifts.
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V063__journey_fact_windowed.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Gold.usp_Load_Fact_Appointment_Journey.StoredProcedure.sql

TEST
